"Knight Rapport 1 is a Privately Governed Territory in the far north of Artona I's biggest continent."
"It is the largest such territory, a knights' forest almost the size of Illinois, with no cities."
"The System also renders its name as Resting Place of the Oathbound or Neighborhood of Honored Warriors."
"Earth's consulate teachers call Privately Governed Territories communities for land preservation."
"Its giant trees are redwood-sized, with nearly black bark and blade-shaped leaves."
"The forest floor has no undergrowth and feels tranquil and warm."
"The trees take in the bodies of released knights through their roots."
"The Art'h Residence, home of the Primary's family, is in Knight Rapport 1."
"The knights' community lives here; Stuart never mixed with anyone outside it before college."
"Alden woke in the forest's roots after the Mother re-affixed his skill."
"Even Grand Senators need permission to teleport into the Rapports."
